BADCAR	That's the wrong car, dumbass!
BARPORT If you continue across the bridge toward Staunton Island, you will be punished.
BARTELP	Do not set foot on our lands again!
BARDONE	The Barrier has been shut off. Proceed at your own peril.
BOAT    Press the ~k~~VEHICLE_ACCELERATE~ key to drive the boat forward.
BOAT2   Press the ~k~~VEHICLE_BRAKE~ key to slow down or reverse.
BOAT3	Press the A or D Keys to steer.
BRIBE   You have just picked up a Police Bribe. Your wanted level has been reduced by one.
CALHAN	The Callahan Bridge is closed due to construction.
CALHAN2	For an alternate route to Staunton Island, please use the Porter Tunnel in Harwood.
CARDIE	The vehicle has been destroyed!
CARHORN	Honk the horn to get her attention.
DRIVE   Press the ~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ ~w~key to enter or exit a vehicle.
DRIVE2  Press the ~k~~VEHICLE_ACCELERATE~ ~w~key to drive forwards.
DRIVE3  Press the ~k~~VEHICLE_BRAKE~ ~w~key to apply the brakes. The vehicle will reverse when stopped.
DRIVE4	Press the A or D Keys to steer.
DRUNK	Wow... She's so drunk she can't even find her way home!
HEAT	Lose the ~r~heat!
INCAR	Get back in the car!
JUNKYRD	Drive to the Junkyard.
FINHIDE Find a place to stay for the night.
FINACAR	Nick a car off the street, and make it snappy!
FINDCAR	Find your car.
FINDPIS	Find a pistol.
FOUNDMS	There she is!
FYBCLOK	Come back before dawn.
HIDEOUT	Get back to your hideout.
GETOUT  Leave this area at once!
GOGAS	Go to the ~y~Gas Station.
GOTHOSP	Drive to the ~g~Hospital.
GTOROOF	How the hell did I get clear up here? How am I supposed to get down?!
LIFTDN	The Lift Bridge between Staunton and Shoreside is now operational.
LIFTUP	The Lift Bridge is currently being repaired. Please come back later.
LI_SHOP	Go to the Shops in Little Italy.
LIQUOR	It looks like she's been raiding her mother's liquor cabinet.
LIQUOR2	She's taking her sweet-ass time walking to her apartment.
LIQUOR3	Maybe you can help her out...
LOADED  Game loaded!
LODKEY  Press the ~y~L Key~s~ to load the game.
LODGAME Please wait...
LODCARS Loading Cars...
LODPACK Loading Packages...
LODPICK Loading Pickups and Objects...
LODGARG Loading Garages...
LODZONE Loading Zones...
LODPATH Loading Restarts and Paths...
MARKER  Drive into the Marker.
MARKERW Walk into the marker to advance.
MEETUP	Meet up with your ~b~girl~w~ and take her to her ~y~apartment.
MEETHER Pick up your girl from her apartment.
MISDEAD	Misty's dead!
MISFAIL	You fucked up!
MISFIND Find Misty!
MISGTWK	Take her to work.
MISLUI  You should go talk to my boss, Louie.
MISLUI2 I'll bet you can convince him to shorten my hours so we can see each other more.
MISLUI3 I hear he likes to go to ~b~Marco's Bistro~w~ for breakfast. It's right around the corner.
MISLUI4 You should be able to find him there this time of day.
MISMONY I know you're a little strapped on cash, so take some of my pocket change.
MISPASS Nice one!
MISRIDE Thanks for the ride to work, babe!
MISSUG  Thanks for the lift, sugar.
MISWAIT Hey, now! Wait for me!
MISWHRE Hey, where are you going?!
MISWORK Good luck! OK, I gotta go, I'm late enough as it is! Love ya, bye!
MISWREK Your car is a wreck! I'm not getting in that shit-heap!
NOCAR   You need a car for this gig!
NOCHASE I'm not chasing you!
NOODLE	Drive to Dong's Noodle Shop.
MISTAXI That's it, I'm taking a taxi!
OUCH	Ouch! That looks like it hurt!
OUTCAR	Get out of the car.
