PACK48	A Rocket Launcher has been delivered to the Mansion!
PACKALL	Nice! That's all the packages!
PACK_ST	You cannot proceed in the ~y~Package Hunt~w~ until you unlock Staunton Island.
PACK_SH	You cannot proceed in the ~y~Package Hunt~w~ until you unlock Shoreside Vale.
PACKDEC	Package count decreased by 1.
PACKDON Package Tracking has become obsolete. You can keep tapping, but nothing interesting will happen.
PACKINC	Package count increased by 1.
PACKON  Package Tracking System Enabled! Disable with the ~y~ O Key.
PACKON1	The Package Tracking System is already on, ~r~dumbass!
PACKOFF Package Tracking System Disabled! Press the ~y~ P Key to re-enable it.
PACKREW	Here's a bonus! $10000
PAKTUT1	You have found a ~y~Hidden Package!
PAKTUT2	If you find and collect them all, you will be greatly rewarded!
PAKTUT3	A ~y~Package Tracking System~w~ is available. Pressing the ~y~ P Key~w~ will turn it on.
PAKTUT4 Pressing the ~y~Comma~w~ or ~y~Period~w~ keys will change the currently tracked package.
SAVE_1  This abandoned house will serve as a nice hideout.
SAVE_2  For now, at least...
SAVE_3  Walking into this sphere behind the bar will save the game.
SAVE_4  When saving the game, you will lose any wanted level you may have, and time will advance by six hours.
